+## Theorem T4 — positive mean-map bounds
+
+For every V,V', `W_1(K_V,K_V')≥|F(V)−F(V')|`. Indeed for any coupling and
+unit d, `|(E s−E s')·d|≤E|s−s'|`. Choose d parallel to the mean difference
